+------------------------------------------------------+
|  abysslink doctor  health check                      |
+------------------------------------------------------+

+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  * INFO — doctor checks known footguns; it is not a full security audit    |
|  abysslink doctor verifies the configuration Abysslink manages.            |
|  It does not replace a professional security audit.                        |
|  See docs/DESIGN.md §6.1 for the scope boundary.                           |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  * SECURITY — Tailscale Funnel is permanently rejected at the schema       |
|  level                                                                     |
|  Abysslink never exposes services to the public internet via Funnel.       |
|  All remote access is restricted to your tailnet only.                     |
|  This is a hard floor — it cannot be configured away.                      |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  tailscale
    ✕  FATAL  installed  tailscale is not installed or not on PATH
        fix: abysslink up --apply 
    ⚠  WARN  funnel-probe-fail  could not determine Funnel state — tailscale funnel command unavailable or returned non-zero exit; re-run after: tailscale status
        fix: ensure tailscaled is running: tailscale status — then re-run abysslink doctor 
  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  tmux
    ⚠  WARN  installed  tmux is not installed or not on PATH
        fix: abysslink up --apply 
  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  hardening
    ✕  FATAL  filevault  disk-encryption state is UNKNOWN: fdesetup exited with a non-zero status — verify FileVault status manually in System Settings → Privacy & Security → FileVault
        fix: System Settings → Privacy & Security → FileVault → Turn On 
    ⚠  WARN  firewall  Application Firewall state is UNKNOWN: system_profiler exited with a non-zero status — verify it manually in System Settings → Network → Firewall
        fix: System Settings → Network → Firewall → Turn On  (macOS) 
  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  ssh
    ⚠  WARN  remote_login_unknown  could not determine macOS Remote Login state from systemsetup output — check System Settings → General → Sharing → Remote Login manually
