  claudecode
    ⚠  WARN  api_key_keychain  Anthropic API key not readable from the keychain (the login keychain may be locked after reboot — unlock it at the console)
        fix: unlock your login keychain in Keychain Access.app 
    ⚠  WARN  stop_hook_configured  ~/.claude/settings.json missing abysslink notify Stop hook (expected command: "abysslink notify \"Claude stopped\" \"Session ended\"")
        fix: abysslink up --apply 
