  supply
    ⚠  WARN  supply-cosign-bundle  dev build — no release bundle available to verify
        fix: Install cosign and re-verify: abysslink verify   (or reinstall from a signed release) 
    ⚠  WARN  supply-slsa-source  no SLSA provenance URL embedded (dev build or pre-v3 release)
        fix: Upgrade to a v3+ release built with SLSA provenance: abysslink upgrade --apply 
